cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Structured Views, please cite it as below. It was co-created with generative AI; see the README's 'Credits and AI disclosure'."
type: software
title: "Structured Views: Rhino's Named Views panel with folders"
version: 0.9.1-beta
date-released: 2026-11-01
license: MIT
authors:
  - alias: adpchrgruber
repository-code: "https://github.com/adpchrgruber/structured_views_Rh8"
abstract: >-
  Rhino 8 plug-in that adds a Named Views panel with nested folders: save, restore,
  update, rename, duplicate, delete, properties, copy and paste, import, sorting,
  thumbnails and animation settings as in Rhino's own panel, plus folders, custom order
  and drag and drop. Folders are stored in the .3dm; views stay ordinary Rhino named
  views. Developed with generative AI assistance (Claude Opus 5.5 in Claude Code,
  Anthropic), directed and reviewed by the author.
keywords:
  - Rhino
  - Rhinoceros 3D
  - named views
  - plug-in
  - architecture
